your comparing apples to oranges - the answer depends on your prefs.

Magicbane (should only be enchanted to +2) has significant defensive
potentials, such that monsters might not attack you, monsters might
attack one another (not using conflict) and monsters that do attack
you might not have their magic attacks work.  it also protects against
non-monster attacks (huh?).

Mjollnir (should be enchanted till it vibrates) is a world class
offensive weapon.  most users will prefer Mjollnir.

